!_*/WTF/Account/*/*/*/macros-cache.txt
!_*/WTF/Account/*/*/*/SavedVariables/
!_*/WTF/Account/*/*/*/SavedVariables/*.lua

# --- WoW: Forever (_forever_): tighter whitelist ------------------------------
# The rules above allow every flavor's WTF + custom addons. For Forever we want
# much less: only the layout files the Steam Deck / ibp pull with
# scripts/sync-forever.sh. Later rules win, so this block first re-denies all of
# _forever_/WTF and _forever_/Interface/AddOns, then re-allows a short list.
#
# Tracked (BLD commits these; other machines pull them):
#   account  SavedVariables/ElvUI.lua     (ElvUI layout; UIScale is kept per machine by the sync script)
#   account  SavedVariables/KeyKit.lua    (KeyKit, account-wide today)
#   per-char SavedVariables/KeyKit.lua    (in case KeyKit goes per-character)
#   account  bindings-cache.wtf
#   per-char bindings-cache.wtf
#   Interface/AddOns/KeyKit/              (our own addon)
#
# Never tracked: WTF/Config.wtf (machine-specific graphics/CVars), per-char
# SavedVariables/ElvUI.lua (holds chat history), chat-cache.txt, macros, and
# every other addon folder (ElvUI, Questie, BadBoy, OPie... install via scripts).
#
# Git can't re-include a file whose parent directory is ignored, so each
# allowed level re-opens its directory (the `!.../` lines) before re-denying
# that directory's contents (the `.../*` lines).

# WTF: deny everything under _forever_/WTF, reopen the Account dir
_forever_/WTF/*
!_forever_/WTF/Account/
# Account level: _forever_/WTF/Account/<ACCOUNT>/...
_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/bindings-cache.wtf
# Reopen subdirs of the account dir: SavedVariables/ and each <Realm>/
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/
_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/*
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/SavedVariables/ElvUI.lua
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/SavedVariables/KeyKit.lua
# Per-character level: _forever_/WTF/Account/<ACCOUNT>/<Realm>/<Character>/...
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/*/
_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/*/*
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/*/bindings-cache.wtf
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/*/SavedVariables/
_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/*/SavedVariables/*
!_forever_/WTF/Account/*/*/*/SavedVariables/KeyKit.lua

# AddOns: only KeyKit. Third-party addons stay untracked.
_forever_/Interface/AddOns/*
!_forever_/Interface/AddOns/KeyKit/
!_forever_/Interface/AddOns/KeyKit/**

# Even within whitelisted paths, always ignore noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.bak
*.old
*.md5
**/config-cache.wtf
**/tts-cache-*.txt
**/Cache/
**/Logs/

# TradeSkillMaster: Desktop App rewrites these constantly; not worth tracking
**/SavedVariables/TradeSkillMaster.lua
**/SavedVariables/TradeSkillMaster_AppHelper.lua
**/SavedVariables/TradeSkillMaster*.lua.bak
